  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero" aria-label="Introduction">
    <p class="h6 hero__kicker">HubSpot · 2025–2026</p>
    <h1 class="display-xl hero__title">Agentic UX vision<br>and implementation<br> for HubSpot's Customer Success</h1>
    <p class="lead hero__sub">Grounded in research, I defined the UX vision that turns days of a rep's manual work into hours through agentic systems, enabling CS reps and teams to hit their raised organizational targets. Further in-depth research and user testing before implementation significantly changed product directions of these agents.</p>
    <dl class="hero__meta">
      <div>
        <dt>Role</dt>
        <dd>UX Lead</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Scope</dt>
        <dd>Research<br>System design<br>Vibecoded prototypes<br>End-to-end experience</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Teams</dt>
        <dd>PM, TL, EL, Group leads<br>Data Science<br>Cross-functional business stakeholders and partners<br>Design System</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Recognition</dt>
        <dd><strong>Craft Award</strong> (among all UX teams) in 2025</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
