    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="actions-view" aria-label="Actions-focused view">
    <div class="media-row media-row--flip">
      <div class="media-row__text">
        <h2 class="media-row__lead">Actions focused view – where things get done</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>This is where the rep moves from one high-impact task to the next, seamlessly.</li>
          <li>Whatever the task - a follow-up, a save play, or a key email - it's already teed up and ready for them to review and confirm. No digging, no switching tools.</li>
          <li>And if they need more context or want to tweak something, the Success Assistant is right there on the side - not flooding them with information, just offering exactly what they need, when they need it.</li>
          <li>With the Success Assistant built in, the rep doesn't work alone. One click to shift focus, refine priorities, or ask it to spotlight something new.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <figure class="media-row__media">
        <button class="zoom" aria-label="Enlarge the actions-focused view">
