    <div class="panel panel--warm">
      <div class="media-row__text">
        <h2 class="media-row__lead">From scattered meeting prep to confident conversations.</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>The Orchestrator triggers the <strong>Meeting Agent</strong> upon reading the rep's calendar and creates prep material for upcoming customer calls.</li>
          <li>The agent performs a comprehensive research of the customer analyzing usage trends, business goals, renewal info, and past engagements. This research used to take days before AI.</li>
          <li>Success Assistant, fully aware of the meeting context, helps the rep with any question they have about the customer — all without leaving their prep view.</li>
          <li>When they highlight a detail, a quick prompt pop-up lets them ask deeper questions in place, making every insight just a click away.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
