    <section class="section" id="live-call" aria-label="Live meeting assistant">
    <div class="media-row media-row--flip">
      <div class="media-row__text">
        <h2 class="media-row__lead">Live meeting assistant: real-time insights during customer call.</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>As the meeting begins, Live Assistant joins the rep on Zoom, quietly listening and providing real-time insights based on the conversation.</li>
          <li>On one tab, they see live insights, relevant discovery questions, next-step ideas, or helpful resources surfaced in the moment.</li>
          <li>On the other, her saved talking points from meeting prep appear, so she never has to switch tabs or windows.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>The rep stays fully present with the customer, listening, engaging, and leading with confidence.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="media-row__media">
        <button class="zoom" aria-label="Enlarge the live meeting assistant">
          <span class="frame"><video autoplay loop muted playsinline aria-label="Live meeting assistant on a Zoom call: real-time insights on one side, saved prep notes on the other"><source src="img/proactive_ai_vision/live-call-assistant.webm" type="video/webm"><source src="img/proactive_ai_vision/live-call-assistant.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></span>
