  <section class="section" id="implementation">
    <p class="eyebrow">The implementation</p>
    <h2 class="h2">How each part got built</h2>
    <p class="lead ds-measure process__intro">Every agent experience went through the same process, from discovery research to a detailed Figma hand-off.</p>

    <ol class="process">
      <li>
        <span class="process__n">01</span>
        <h3 class="h5 process__title">Discovery research</h3>
        <p class="small process__desc">In-depth interviews with reps of varying tenure across every region, plus prototype testing to find the gaps.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="process__n">02</span>
        <h3 class="h5 process__title">Findings and direction</h3>
        <p class="small process__desc">Published the findings with a recommended design direction, then shared them with teams and business stakeholders for visibility and alignment.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="process__n">03</span>
        <h3 class="h5 process__title">Iterate the prototype</h3>
        <p class="small process__desc">Reworked the prototype to incorporate the findings, partnering with the Design System team to build new components or patterns where needed.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="process__n">04</span>
        <h3 class="h5 process__title">Design spec hand-off</h3>
        <p class="small process__desc">Handed off a detailed Figma design spec for build.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <figure class="figure process__proof">
      <span class="frame"><img src="img/proactive_ai_vision/research-docs.png" alt="The research paper trail: discovery plan, interview guide, research synthesis, and Figma hand-off spec."></span>
      <figcaption class="figcaption">The paper trail behind every part: discovery plan, interview guide, research synthesis, and design decisions.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

