  <section class="section" id="key-findings">
    <p class="eyebrow">Vision vs. the implementation</p>
    <h2 class="h2">Key discovery moments</h2>
    <p class="lead ds-measure">Five moments where user research and testing reshaped the design, and one that changed the whole product direction.</p>

    <div class="fgroup">
      <div class="fgroup__head"><h3 class="h5 fgroup__n">Outreach Agent</h3></div>

      <div class="finding">
        <div class="finding__insight">
          <p class="finding__label">Finding 01</p>
          <p class="lead">Reps loved a draft prepared for review, but they wouldn't send it. They couldn't see how the agent decided what to write, and checking it by hand meant redoing the exact manual work the agent was meant to remove.</p>
          <p class="body finding__body">So I surfaced the agent's reasoning and its source citations at the top of the email composer, with the generated draft directly below. Reps could see why each point was made, and trust the draft enough to actually send it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="finding__response">
          <figure class="figure finding__fig"><button class="zoom" aria-label="Enlarge the email composer"><span class="frame"><img src="img/proactive_ai_vision/outreach-agent.png" alt="Email composer showing the agent's reasoning and source citations above the generated draft."></span><span class="zoom__hint"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 9V4h5M15 4h5v5M20 15v5h-5M9 20H4v-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span></button><figcaption class="figcaption">Reasoning and sources sit above the draft, so the rep can verify without redoing the research.</figcaption></figure>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="finding">
        <div class="finding__insight">
          <p class="finding__label">Finding 02</p>
          <p class="lead">Our design system wasn't ready for AI patterns. The composer could only Regenerate at random, with no way to steer it by prompt, and without real control reps would never feel ownership of the output.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="finding__response">
          <p class="finding__label" aria-hidden="true" style="visibility:hidden;">Finding 02</p>
          <p class="body finding__body">This was a moment I broke from my usual approach and did not reuse an existing component. I pushed to build a new prompt-driven Regenerate for Alpha, even though it meant a significant increase in engineering scope, and made the case that it was too integral to cut. I took the design to the Design System team to implement as a shared pattern, which other teams later reused.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="fgroup">
      <div class="fgroup__head"><h3 class="h5 fgroup__n">Meeting Prep</h3></div>
      <div class="finding-pair">
        <div class="fitem">
          <p class="fitem__label">Finding 03</p>
          <p class="lead">Prep had to arrive in the customer's language. Otherwise reps would translate and rewrite it themselves, spending the very time we were trying to save and putting adoption targets at risk.</p>
          <p class="body fitem__body">So prep generates in the customer's language from the start, with no manual translation step.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fitem">
          <p class="fitem__label">Finding 04</p>
          <p class="lead">Junior reps wanted detailed prep; tenured reps wanted high-level bullets and the choice to dig deeper only when needed. Everyone wanted to spend as little time as possible getting current on a customer.</p>
          <p class="body fitem__body">So the system tailors the depth of prep to the rep's tenure and seniority. Anyone can Regenerate to adjust, and the system learns and adapts to their preference over time.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="fgroup">
      <div class="fgroup__head"><h3 class="h5 fgroup__n">Meeting Recap</h3></div>

      <div class="finding">
        <div class="finding__insight">
          <p class="finding__label">Finding 05</p>
          <p class="lead">The finding that changed the most. I assumed reps needed a summary and notes captured to the customer record. The real pain was doing the action items from the call, the research and follow-up that came after.</p>
          <p class="body finding__body">So I reframed Recap from a note-taker into a follow-through system that drafts what the rep needs to do next. When a follow-up email is needed, it triggers the Outreach Agent to prepare it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="finding__response">
          <figure class="figure finding__fig"><button class="zoom" aria-label="Enlarge the follow-through system"><span class="frame"><video autoplay loop muted playsinline aria-label="The follow-through system drafting the rep's action items from the call."><source src="img/proactive_ai_vision/meeting-follow-through.webm" type="video/webm"><source src="img/proactive_ai_vision/meeting-follow-through.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></span><span class="zoom__hint"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 9V4h5M15 4h5v5M20 15v5h-5M9 20H4v-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span></button><figcaption class="figcaption">Recap becomes a follow-through system, drafting the action items and the follow-up email.</figcaption></figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- OUTCOMES -->
  <section class="section" id="outcomes" aria-label="The outcome">
    <p class="eyebrow">The outcome</p>
    <h2 class="h2">Shipped to every rep, and adopted fast</h2>
    <p class="lead">During my time on the team we shipped Outreach, Meeting Prep, and Recap to every CS rep. Those three reshaped how CS runs day to day and helped move the org's revenue targets. The rest of the vision was still in build.</p>

    <!-- Outreach agent -->
    <div class="o-agent">
      <h3 class="h4 o-agent__name">Outreach agent</h3>
      <div class="split">
        <div class="stat stat--hero">
          <span class="stat__num display-xl" data-to="90" data-prefix="~" data-suffix="%">~0%</span>
          <span class="stat__label">of reps were exceeding their monthly connected-call target of 80. This agent made outreach leading to a connected call significantly faster.</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="label o-avail">Post global availability</p>
          <div class="stats">
            <div class="stat"><span class="stat__num display-l" data-to="98" data-suffix="%">0%</span><span class="stat__label">Adoption</span></div>
            <div class="stat"><span class="stat__num display-l" data-to="81" data-suffix="%">0%</span><span class="stat__label">Retention</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="panel panel--warm o-quotes">
        <p class="h5 o-quotes__head">What reps said</p>
        <div class="figure-row figure-row--3">
          <figure class="o-quote"><p class="rec__mark"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9.5 6C6.46 6 4 8.46 4 11.5V18h6.5v-6.5H7.5c0-1.66 1.34-3 3-3V6Zm10 0C16.46 6 14 8.46 14 11.5V18h6.5v-6.5h-3c0-1.66 1.34-3 3-3V6Z"/></svg></p><blockquote class="body">What usually takes me 2 to 3 hours was done in 10 to 15 minutes. While writing the message, two customers already booked a call.</blockquote><figcaption class="small-strong o-quote__by">Senior CSM, Upmarket</figcaption></figure>
          <figure class="o-quote"><p class="rec__mark"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9.5 6C6.46 6 4 8.46 4 11.5V18h6.5v-6.5H7.5c0-1.66 1.34-3 3-3V6Zm10 0C16.46 6 14 8.46 14 11.5V18h6.5v-6.5h-3c0-1.66 1.34-3 3-3V6Z"/></svg></p><blockquote class="body">They're brilliant. It doesn't sound too AI, and it adapts the language between Swedish and English.</blockquote><figcaption class="small-strong o-quote__by">Lead CSM, Upmarket</figcaption></figure>
          <figure class="o-quote"><p class="rec__mark"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9.5 6C6.46 6 4 8.46 4 11.5V18h6.5v-6.5H7.5c0-1.66 1.34-3 3-3V6Zm10 0C16.46 6 14 8.46 14 11.5V18h6.5v-6.5h-3c0-1.66 1.34-3 3-3V6Z"/></svg></p><blockquote class="body">Cutting 2 to 3 hours down to about 15 minutes, and driving bookings while you write, is next level.</blockquote><figcaption class="small-strong o-quote__by">Lead CSM, Upmarket</figcaption></figure>
        </div>
        <button class="btn btn--secondary btn--sm" id="moreReactions" type="button" data-img="img/proactive_ai_vision/oa-reaction.png" data-alt="Slack thread of Upmarket CSM reactions to the Outreach Agent">More rep quotes</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Meeting prep + recap -->
    <div class="o-agent">
      <div class="split">
        <div>
          <h3 class="h4 o-agent__name">Meeting prep</h3>
          <div class="stat stat--hero">
            <span class="stat__num display-l" data-to="15" data-prefix="~" data-suffix=" min">~0 min</span>
            <span class="stat__label">down from about 2 hours average prep time.</span>
          </div>
          <p class="label o-avail">Post global availability</p>
          <div class="stats">
            <div class="stat"><span class="stat__num display-l" data-to="94" data-suffix="%">0%</span><span class="stat__label">Adoption</span></div>
            <div class="stat"><span class="stat__num display-l" data-to="84" data-suffix="%">0%</span><span class="stat__label">Retention</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="h4 o-agent__name">Meeting recap</h3>
          <div class="stat stat--hero">
            <span class="stat__num display-l" data-to="40" data-suffix=" min">~0 min</span>
            <span class="stat__label">down from a two-day average follow-up.</span>
          </div>
          <p class="label o-avail">Post global availability</p>
          <div class="stats">
            <div class="stat"><span class="stat__num display-l" data-to="96" data-suffix="%">0%</span><span class="stat__label">Adoption</span></div>
            <div class="stat"><span class="stat__num display-l" data-to="88" data-suffix="%">0%</span><span class="stat__label">Retention</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Recognition -->
    <div class="split o-award">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Recognition</p>
        <h1>A UX Craft Award for the vision</h1>
        <p>In Q3 2025 this work earned a Craft Award, selected among all ux team works and awarded during "UX All Teams" meeting.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="figure finding__fig"><button class="zoom" aria-label="Enlarge the email composer"><span class="frame"><img src="img/proactive_ai_vision/craft-award.jpg" alt="Company UX all hand announcement for craft award"></span><span class="zoom__hint"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 9V4h5M15 4h5v5M20 15v5h-5M9 20H4v-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span></button></figure>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

<div class="lightbox" id="lightbox" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Enlarged view">
  <div class="lightbox__scrim" data-close></div>
  <button class="lightbox__close" id="lbClose" aria-label="Close"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button>
  <div class="lightbox__content" id="lbContent"></div>
</div>
